@Host = http://localhost:5137

### 1. Get OpenID Connect Discovery Document
GET {{Host}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

### 2. Request Access Token (Client Credentials)
POST {{Host}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=machine_worker&client_secret=worker_secret_key_123&scope=IdentityServerApi

### 3. Get Inventory (Unauthorized without token)
GET {{Host}}/api/inventory

### 4. Create Inventory Item (Unauthorized without token)
POST {{Host}}/api/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-HEADSET-04",
  "name": "Noise Cancelling Headset",
  "stockQuantity": 50,
  "unitPrice": 199.99
}
